WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.250
I'm delighted that you invited me.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:10.040
I must make her
 fit to become a princess.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.360
Even though Jiro and Chief
 think of her as just a witch?

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.870
She has the power
 to enchant many humans,

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:21.200
and makes them seal contracts
 without realizing it.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.000
That makes her stronger.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.500
In other words, she's no witch.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.750
We don't use the word "devil."

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.160
She's a being who is obligated
 to rule in a different dimension.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.260
Don't beat around the bush.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:40.040
As her guardian,
 her infatuation with Jiro worries you.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.040
It could affect her mission.
 Same for you, right?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:49.040
I just don't want her being flirty
 with my precious boyfriend.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.290
- Earth-chan!
 - What? Where?

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:01.370
The more your princess
 does good deeds in this world,

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.290
the more human souls
 she can gather, right?

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.330
And?

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:06.660
Did you know?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.120
That mechanical doll is the same.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:29.330
Concrete Revolutio
 ~Superhuman Phantasmagoria~

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:36.450
I heard it
 A voice cursing fate

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:40.620
I found it
 A way to use my power

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:44.410
What you want are not words,
 are they?

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.790
That love inside
 I want to send it on

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.580
Justice is not on my side

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:54.950
The only thing absolute for me
 is myself

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.450
Come on Wakers. Ready, go!

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:02.450
Protecting the illusions
 that somebody dreamed of

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.950
will liberate the stagnant sky

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:12.620
We hurl our unanswerable cries
 at each other

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:17.450
And they become the reason we live

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.120
What can I do in this
 hopeless world we live in?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:28.200
Only those that keep searching

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.080
can become the future

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:35.040
Start the revolution!

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.500
(LET'S GO PAST
 THE SKY AND THE STARS)

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.020
Are you Mr. Judas?

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:50.580
Um, yes.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:52.270
Sorry I'm late.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.700
- You're from the Superhuman Bureau?
 - Yes.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.860
I'll take you to the office.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:04.950
I heard you helped defeat the armed
 robbery group Diamond Eater last year.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:07.040
I didn't do anything.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.410
What have you been doing since?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.200
Superhuman activities elsewhere?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.830
Judas!

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:15.700
Earth-chan?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.800
You're out of prison now,
 but I bet you'll do bad again.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.200
So I'm going to defeat you now.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.430
Meteortail!

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:34.060
Earth-chan, he is a superhuman
 that's going to be newly registered.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.150
Just like you.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.700
Ullr, let me set the channel.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.290
Ullr?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.660
- Come!
 - Yes.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.210
But...

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.720
I've got my eye on you.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:04.330
He was really in prison?

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.220
We wouldn't joke about that.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.950
A prison for superhumans, of course.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.660
But why, Mr. Judas?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.980
Because...

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.980
I was a mutant of Diamond Eater.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.080
The newspaper from July, 2 years ago.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.580
But it says "armed robbery."

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:26.990
Superhumans can't be in the news
 because of the Functional Secrecy Law.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.910
Superhumans aren't just
 people with super powers.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:36.750
It includes people who use devilish
 inventions and ancient super weapons.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.250
My diamond!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.270
Judas.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.000
He's just a kid.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.140
And no weapons.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.950
- He's an evil superhuman.
 - Get backup!

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.370
How weak they are.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.990
You jerk!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.500
Why do such bad things?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.120
Earth-chan? I'd never seen her.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:21.750
You wouldn't understand.
 A child, let alone a machine.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.880
What don't I understand?

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:28.080
Earth-chan, I learned
 about wars in college.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.660
And I understand now.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:33.580
War never disappears
 because foolish old-type humans...

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.620
You jerk!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.620
You little...

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:43.080
If you're so smart, why can't you tell
 between good and bad?

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.610
This world isn't that simple.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:46.740
Don't lie!

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.660
Lying is bad.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:55.080
So you repented and
 became a superhuman of justice.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.120
No. The story continues.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.120
Lots happened,
 he served time in prison,

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.250
and now he'll be
 registered at the Bureau.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.410
Sign and thumb print here.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.870
And this.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.620
It shows you're
 a superhuman of justice,

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:12.290
and evil organizations
 won't recruit you.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:15.660
I hope to protect
 young people like me.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.560
So you like Earth-chan now.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:23.950
I think it's amazing how she
 clearly states what's good.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.290
Then I have the perfect job for you.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.320
Could you go talk to Earth-chan?

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.160
To clear up her misunderstanding
 of Mr. Judas?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.660
No, I just want to contact her.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.080
So we're going to accept that job?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.040
Of course. We're a state institution.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.090
Where's the ghost boy?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.340
Undercover investigation
 for another case.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:47.590
Excuse me.

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:51.870
- Where's Mountain Horses' room?
 - No one else can see her.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.910
Yes, Kikko?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:58.250
If you just want to contact her,
 why don't you call her?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.250
I can't fly well.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.740
I said there's no air.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.910
Ride the light, not the wind.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.000
Good morning, Earth-chan.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:29.120
Health and Welfare Ministry's
 Super Population Research Laboratory.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.540
I'm Kikko Hoshino of
 the Superhuman Bureau.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:36.000
We'd like to contact you,
 so would you take this?

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.700
I was tricked by you guys.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.830
I'm back with new powers.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.580
Help me!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.370
I heard this place is really wicked.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.700
Hey, look!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.250
Let her go.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:03.000
Earth-chan. No, I'm not like that.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.750
Maybe Earth-chan is
 here to beat the company.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:11.370
They took advantage of my ignorance
 and sold me crummy stocks.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.760
Then scientists used my body
 for their experiments.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.080
I'm the victim, I'm not the bad guy.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.520
I know good from bad.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.080
So he's the bad one, huh?

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.700
If Earth-chan says so, then yeah.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.160
Miss Earth-chan!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.160
The witch girl.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.160
- She's tied up.
 - Yeah.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.460
Hey, wait!

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:21.750
Umm...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:50.770
I was wishing you'd come.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.530
That's why I came.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.370
Can you help me?

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:59.040
What's causing you pain?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:15.340
Either way, there will be
 smog again tomorrow.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.660
But it might make someone realize

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:23.000
that it can't go on like this,
 and Earth-chan is telling that.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.870
Seiji!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.450
What is it, Hoshinoko?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.040
Done for today?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.700
I'll go if someone calls for me.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.750
Good work today.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.250
Have this.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.710
I'm solar powered. I don't need food.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.290
I know.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:11:00.410
This lets machines dream
 just like humans do.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.200
Dream?

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.120
Have a good night's rest.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.230
My body is so sore.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:20.160
I feel like I flew three laps
 around the globe.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:23.000
When humans plead genuinely for help,

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.200
a certain brain wave is emitted.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.870
That mechanical doll catches them.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.500
Where did you find that out?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.080
Well, you know...

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:36.590
Anyway, catching those waves
 feels good for her.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.160
I've no idea who made her though.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.250
It was probably a good alien.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:43.620
A heart that seeks genuine pleas...

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.080
Someone created
 just for saving people...

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.080
Do you really believe that?

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.350
Senpai?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.080
Why are you here?

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:52.980
He let me in.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.560
Some tea? Ullr, too?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:58.190
Still acting like a doll to me?

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.950
Why are you here too?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.410
It's tough working under the band.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.030
- Listen...
 - No.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.660
So why'd you come?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.000
Because you haven't reported anything.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.750
Did you talk to Earth-chan?

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.040
Well...

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.790
The Prime Minister
 has a meeting in 2 days.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:19.580
Japan's participation in the EDC,
 Earth Defense Corps, will be decided.

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:23.180
An organization to protect Earth
 from evil aliens, yes?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.700
But many people oppose it.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:29.040
Many youth thought to be superhumans
 are in the protest.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:32.580
Haneda Airport will likely be
 the biggest protest.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.910
And you want Earth-chan to
 guard the Prime Minister.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:38.320
I'm sure she'll agree to do it.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.950
But wasn't Earth-chan
 on the students' side?

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.080
What?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:50.000
Master Ultima's team of beasts tried
 to stop at Japan's port this summer.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.000
Earth-chan was at
 the center of protests.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.910
She sent him away.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.080
Why?

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.580
I don't know.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:01.840
But it made the public oppose
 the usage of beasts in wars.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.040
It was more effective than
 when we defeated MegaGon.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.370
In other words, if Earth-chan
 guards the prime minister,

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:14.120
the public will accept
 Japan's participation in EDC.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.980
But isn't that the other way around?

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.160
Earth-chan sides with what's right,

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:23.370
but it's not that
 whatever she protects is right.

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.750
It is.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.830
No, we'll make it like that.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:32.290
Senpai, you don't want to
 use Earth-chan, do you?

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.920
So you won't allow me?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.300
You? In the protests?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:45.080
EDC fights bad aliens, right?

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:48.800
But there might be
 good superhumans among aliens.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:52.060
That's why I'll protest.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:55.790
If the riot squad arrests you,
 the Bureau can't help you.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.810
Don't talk about
 superhumans so loudly.

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:01.080
It's fine in this place.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.540
What?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:03.790
It's a free zone.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.000
Superhumans,

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:09.620
and at times evil organizations,
 can gather without cover.

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:11.330
That's the rule here.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.290
Let me tell you this.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:17.040
The Superhuman Bureau is for
 Japan's participation in EDC.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.580
They're trying to use us in war again.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.710
Let Master Ultima
 take care of bad aliens.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.470
Earth-chan!

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.950
Didn't expect you here.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.620
I heard that.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.830
You'll do something illegal?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.230
Nonsense.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.540
Earth-chan, he's not
 an evil superhuman anymore.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.110
- It's okay.
 - But...

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:48.290
It's my fault that
 she won't forgive me.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:49.740
You lied.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.080
Lying is bad!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.870
Don't run.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.500
Earth-chan, I was wrong.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.200
I'll use my powers
 to do good from now.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:09.080
I seriously tried to
 take the correct path.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:14.250
But in the end, I went back
 to the evil organization.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:15.910
You were threatened?

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.080
No.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:20.700
They were the only ones
 that accepted me.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.080
So I stayed.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.770
You were weak.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:28.320
The Bureau found me and
 asked for the organization's secrets.

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.570
And I finally made up my mind.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.820
I will do right from now on.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.660
That's why I helped defeat
 the Diamond Eaters.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:40.290
So you turned to justice in the end.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.580
Earth-chan.
 Humans aren't perfect like you.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.090
You lied.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.460
You said you'd be good, so why?

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:51.540
You don't understand why humans lie?

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:52.950
Really?

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.660
I will walk the right path this time.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.700
The protest isn't for myself.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.850
Protest? Violence again?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.230
Because I believe it's what's right.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.910
Alright, I'll promise.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:11.450
I won't use my superhuman powers.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:16.250
I'll join the protest as a youth,
 not as a superhuman.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.330
Will you trust me then?

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:32.000
Earth-chan, did you have a dream?

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:38.890
Watch out.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.160
The girl from the Bureau is a witch.

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.140
Witch?

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.120
They've sold their soul to the devil.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:49.870
I'm of the Strange Power
 Risk Management Office.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:53.030
We fight unnatural phenomena
 and occultists.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.030
I won't be tricked by a witch.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:03.200
At Haneda Airport, the riot squad and
 the protestors are at a standoff.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:07.420
The latest model plane with the
 Prime Minister hasn't left yet.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:11.620
So, we couldn't get Earth-chan
 to guard the Prime Minister.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.300
At least she's there at the site.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:24.390
2, 3, 4.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.250
They have an innocent look...

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.950
There's no beating them.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:41.200
It's a superhuman.
 Neutralize it first.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.200
It's started.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.960
What if Earth-chan takes
 the protestors' side?

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.830
It only helps those
 who give a genuine SOS.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:55.340
I don't know about those
 seeking chaos and destruction.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.250
And you can say
 that Earth-chan is right?

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:00.200
Nobody said that.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.370
But the public will support
 whichever side she takes.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:05.910
So we can't cross her.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.200
Don't push anymore.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.870
Judas, you lied again.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.830
Set witch power channel. Meteortail!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.160
Wait, Kikko.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.500
I won't lose this time.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.120
Can't use electricity now.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.050
- You liar.
 - Stop, Earth-chan.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:44.430
You witch.
 So you're on evil's side too.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:48.690
Meteortail!

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:59.290
Earth-chan, listen.
 I also think doing bad is wrong.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.580
But humans can never stay
 absolutely right.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.660
That's not true.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:07.000
Earth-chan,
 you think you only do what's right?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.160
Senpai?

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:11.580
Human brain waves seeking help
 give you pleasure.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:13.840
That's your power source.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.870
You're made like that.

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:18.290
I know.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:32.160
Is this a dream?

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.330
The more SOS brain waves there are,

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:37.040
the better you feel.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.360
That means your creator

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.580
didn't do it to help humans.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.000
It was to torture...

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.250
No!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.750
That's not true, Kikko.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.620
Earth-chan is right.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:50.910
But...

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:55.000
2 years ago,
 Earth-chan appeared in front of me

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.500
because my heart
 was crying for help.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:00.010
"I want someone to stop me."

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:04.260
Only Earth-chan realized
 the cries of my heart.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:05.750
He...

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:08.200
He was crushed
 by a water cannon truck.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.180
I tried to help him.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:13.190
That's why you used your powers.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.910
I'm sorry, Earth-chan.
 I broke my promise.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:21.830
I don't think I can ever be
 a superhuman of justice like you.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.200
I'll take him to the hospital.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.620
The Prime Minister
 has finally departed.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:42.000
Japan's participation in EDC
 will be finalized at the conference.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:45.220
We will join hands together
 for a new future...

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.610
Undo the magic you put on me.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.910
I haven't been able to sleep since.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.620
Is this what you're talking about?

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.750
What is this?

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.620
What did you do to me?

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.500
Earth-chan, this is...

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:18.080
a lie.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.290
A lie?

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.370
Lies are necessary
 for people sometimes.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.700
Maybe for you, too.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:33.660
The taste of a lie.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.080
Earth-chan.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:42.030
- Sis.
 - Hurry up.

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:38.060
Thanks, Megasshin.

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:45.750
Is this it, Judas?

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:47.070
Yeah.

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:48.700
Earth-chan.

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:51.870
I promise to make you normal again.

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:55.910
(April, the 47th of Shinka Era
 Ikuta Laboratory Annex)

00:23:57.080 --> 00:24:00.580
Boys of Light.
 We're the boys' Detective Team BL.

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:05.290
Bin, Morry, Saki, Hideaki,
 and Yumihiko Otonashi.

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:08.790
The metal giant
 that appears during a crisis,

00:24:08.830 --> 00:24:10.250
Gigander Seven.
